### grepping ps aux output
ps aux | grep nginx
>>> SC2009 1:1

### ps restricted by pgrep pids is fine
ps -o pid=,comm= -p $(pgrep -d, nginx) | grep -F nginx
>>> none

### clustered short flag containing p is fine
ps -fp 1234 | grep java
>>> none

### long pid option is fine
ps --pid=4321 | grep java
>>> none

### quick-pid long option is fine
ps --quick-pid 4321 | grep java
>>> none
